# The spec of kit::keysheet (KIT3): one wording per System action and one
# spelling per key of a chord, in every look. Read by the kit cell
# (crates/chora-kit/tests/keysheet.rs), the xp cell (plugins/chora-xp
# help.rs) and the act `the key list of ...` (tests/acts/looks/common.py).
# Lines: `words<TAB>action<TAB>English<TAB>German`, and
# `cap<TAB>key<TAB>spelling`. An action with an argument is written as
# the shipped keys bind it; `{}` stands for the argument.
words	keys	All keys	Alle Tasten
words	chat	Chat with a helper	Mit einem Helfer chatten
words	lock	Lock the screen	Bildschirm sperren
words	power	Power menu	Ausschalt-Menü
words	screenshot	Take a screenshot	Bildschirmfoto aufnehmen
words	volume:up	Volume up	Lauter
words	volume:down	Volume down	Leiser
words	volume:mute	Mute	Stumm
words	volume:set	Set the volume to {}%	Lautstärke auf {} %
words	close	Close window	Fenster schließen
words	drag	Drag window	Fenster ziehen
words	terminal	Open a terminal	Terminal öffnen
words	launcher	Start a program or run a command	Programm starten oder Befehl ausführen
words	run:fuzzel	Start a program or run a command	Programm starten oder Befehl ausführen
words	run	Run {}	{} ausführen
words	give	Give window to {}	Fenster geben an {}
words	desk:next	Next desk	Nächster Desktop
words	desk:previous	Previous desk	Voriger Desktop
words	cube:left	Turn the cube to the left	Würfel nach links drehen
words	cube:right	Turn the cube to the right	Würfel nach rechts drehen
cap	Escape	Esc
cap	Return	Return
cap	KP_Enter	Return
cap	space	Space
cap	slash	/
cap	period	.
cap	Left	←
cap	Right	→
cap	Up	↑
cap	Down	↓
cap	XF86AudioRaiseVolume	Vol+
cap	XF86AudioLowerVolume	Vol-
cap	XF86AudioMute	Mute
cap	BTN_LEFT	drag
cap	F1	F1
cap	t	T
